  "_commit": {
    "id": "5c4e99d743b86fc2ada74a49fd39079adae82779",
    "author": "Patrick Aboyoun <aboyoun.patrick@gene.com>",
    "committer": "Patrick Aboyoun <aboyoun.patrick@gene.com>",
    "message": "Fix st_as_sfc() binder error on already-GEOMETRY-typed columns\n\nst_as_sfc.DuckDBTable unconditionally applied ST_GeomFromText (or the\nWKB/GeoJSON variant) to every column, assuming it was always stored as\ntext needing conversion. A column already read back as native GEOMETRY\n(e.g. via readGeoParquet(), which can tag it with a CRS like\nGEOMETRY('OGC:CRS84')) fails that call at the DuckDB binder, since\nST_GeomFromText only accepts VARCHAR. Check each column's type via\ncoltypes() first and leave already-GEOMETRY columns untouched.\n",
    "time": 1793293150
  },
